---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Account Management">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Account Management</h1>

    <h2>Plan Section</h2>
    <p>View and manage your subscription:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Current plan details and features</li>
      <li>Upgrade options for additional features</li>
      <li>Downgrade options (previous work is saved, but its visibility or use may be limited)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-info">
      <h3>Understanding Plan Changes</h3>
      <p><strong>When you upgrade:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access to new features is immediate</li>
        <li>All existing banners remain active</li>
        <li>Create more banners based on your new plan limits</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>When you downgrade:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Existing work is preserved but may not be visible</li>
        <li>Advanced features may become unavailable</li>
        <li>You can re-upgrade at any time to restore full functionality</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Settings Section</h2>
    <p>Configure app preferences:</p>

    <h3>Interface Language</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Choose your preferred language for the app interface</li>
      <li>Available in multiple languages</li>
      <li>Changes apply immediately</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Email Address</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Update communication preferences</li>
      <li>Receive notifications about:</li>
      <ul>
        <li>Banner performance</li>
        <li>System updates</li>
        <li>New features</li>
        <li>Important announcements</li>
      </ul>
    </ul>

    <h3>Data Usage</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Configure how your data is used</li>
      <li>Opt in or out of analytics</li>
      <li>Manage data sharing preferences</li>
      <li>Privacy controls</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Privacy First:</strong> We respect your privacy and only collect data necessary to improve your experience. You have full control over your data preferences.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Billing and Invoices</h2>
    <p>Manage your subscription billing:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>View payment history</li>
      <li>Download invoices</li>
      <li>Update payment methods</li>
      <li>View next billing date</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Annual plans typically offer significant savings compared to monthly billing. Check your plan options for available discounts.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href="/docs/advanced-features" class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Advanced Features
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/support-feedback" class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Support & Feedback →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
